  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IM UNICEF Libanon 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lebanon is facing a rapidly worsening humanitarian crisis, with displacement likely far exceeding initial estimates and shelter capacity already near collapse, as most sites are full and new locations are urgently being opened. Ongoing challenges in data collection, coordination, and information sharing are limiting a clear understanding of needs and gaps. Providing dedicated information management expertise to UNICEF is critical to improve real-time data, strengthen coordination, and enable faster, evidence-based decisions to effectively scale up the response.</narrative>
  </description>
